   $q$The word "skeptical" in paragraph 1 is set in contrast with Leilani being "thrilled." What does "skeptical" mean?$q$, $q$[{"text":"excited about a new project","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"ignores-contrast"},{"text":"doubtful that something will work out","is_correct":true},{"text":"talented at drawing and painting","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unrelated-meaning"},{"text":"worried about getting paint on clothes","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$doubtful that something will work out$q$, $q$Dmitri says "The owner will never agree" and predicts rain, which shows he doubts the plan will work. Being excited describes Leilani, the person he is contrasted with.$q$, 'draft', '337b6a72-8c9c-5cc9-bd7e-7d39ff42813c')
