   $q$Coach Varga's team keeps a weekly rest day "even during tournaments." What does this detail suggest about his view?$q$, $q$[{"text":"He believes tournaments are less important than regular practices.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"He believes winning games matters more to him than player health.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"He believes rest helps performance enough to keep it when games matter most.","is_correct":true},{"text":"He believes his players rarely get hurt, so rest is a small reward.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$He believes rest helps performance enough to keep it when games matter most.$q$, $q$Tournaments are when a coach would be most tempted to skip rest, so keeping it then shows he sees rest as "part of the training plan." The passage says nothing about how often his players get hurt.$q$, 'draft', 'c4cb6e84-5cb9-5608-acfd-145dea8d4e7f')
