   $q$By the 4:02 note, what does the reader understand that neither sibling will admit?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Dad has asked both siblings to stay out of the kitchen.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Lucia really is doing a science project that uses the oven.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"Isaac is trying to fix the oven before Dad comes home.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"Both siblings are secretly baking a birthday cake for Dad.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Both siblings are secretly baking a birthday cake for Dad.$q$, $q$Lucia hides powdered sugar and Isaac hides birthday candles, so the reader can tell both are baking for Dad's birthday. Taking the "science project" excuse at face value misses the clues the notes reveal.$q$, 'draft', 'cabc8f59-a363-5b75-91fe-2818cb53b2a8')
