   $q$Which statement best expresses the central idea of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Athletes should stop lifting weights and spend their training time resting instead.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-claim"},{"text":"Basketball players must practice a new shot many times before they use it in a game.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Sleep is an essential part of athletic training because it helps the body and brain improve.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Coaches today care more about how their players sleep than about winning games.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sleep is an essential part of athletic training because it helps the body and brain improve.$q$, $q$The passage shows how sleep repairs muscles, stores skills and prevents mistakes, so sleep is part of training. It never says athletes should replace exercise with rest.$q$, 'draft', '6de16dd4-85f3-5c0d-b068-0e228c072659')
