   $q$Which is the best objective summary of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Sleep helps athletes repair muscles and learn skills. Any athlete who stays up late is lazy and does not deserve a spot on a school team.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"},{"text":"Athletes get hurt mainly because coaches hold practices too late at night. Moving practices earlier would prevent nearly all sports injuries.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Sleep helps athletes repair muscles, store new skills, and stay focused and safe. Because of this, many coaches now include sleep habits in their training plans.","is_correct":true},{"text":"A track coach asks her runners to record their sleep with their running times. She tells them rest is a workout they cannot skip.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sleep helps athletes repair muscles, store new skills, and stay focused and safe. Because of this, many coaches now include sleep habits in their training plans.$q$, $q$The choice about repairing muscles, storing skills and coaches' training plans states each supporting idea and the coaches' response without judgment. The coach example is accurate, but it covers only one detail from the last paragraph.$q$, 'draft', '6de16dd4-85f3-5c0d-b068-0e228c072659')
