   $q$What job does the speaker's uncle most likely have?$q$, $q$[{"text":"He writes articles for a newspaper.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"He drives the speaker's school bus.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-characters"},{"text":"He cleans offices late at night.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"He works as a baker in a shop.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$He works as a baker in a shop.$q$, $q$The flour-dusted note, the warm rolls, the smell of cinnamon and the shop where he shows the speaker the dough all point to baking. Ms. Delgado is the bus driver, not the uncle.$q$, 'draft', '07fb6fed-7705-5e89-8bcd-aa3f85115900')
