   $q$Which best describes the overall structure of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It compares and contrasts two muscle fiber types and the runners who use them.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It describes a common running injury and then explains how to treat it.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-structure"},{"text":"It lists general training tips without comparing different athletes.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"It tells the history of track and field events in chronological order.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-structure"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It compares and contrasts two muscle fiber types and the runners who use them.$q$, $q$Paragraphs 2 and 3 set fast-twitch and slow-twitch fibers side by side, and the conclusion says runners are "strong in different ways." The training details are part of the comparison, not a separate list.$q$, 'draft', '52c4bad8-9e4f-5766-b1ff-f335540105e2')
