  ('a6e962df-f199-5342-a4f7-b4a190e219af', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g8-theme-summary'), null, 'hard',
   $q$How does the detail about the newspaper near the end develop the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows that the flood was too small to be worth writing about.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"It shows that records can leave out ordinary people, which is why her interview matters.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It suggests that Mr. Washington made up parts of his story.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It proves that online archives are always more reliable than interviews.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It shows that records can leave out ordinary people, which is why her interview matters.$q$, $q$The newspaper gives the flood one paragraph and skips the switchboard, so Zainab's interview saves a story the record missed. Nothing in the text suggests Mr. Washington invented his story.$q$, 'draft', 'feb0921d-e7e7-5ed4-83c7-6817a1fb8590')
